# Student Performance Analysis & Prediction

## About the Project

This is a Data Science and AI project that analyzes student performance using study hours, attendance, assignment scores, and previous scores.

## Technologies Used

- Python
- Pandas
- NumPy
- Matplotlib
- Seaborn
- Scikit-learn
- Google Colab

## Project Features

- Dataset creation and analysis
- Missing value checking
- Statistical analysis
- Data visualization
- Correlation heatmap
- Top student analysis
- Machine Learning prediction using Linear Regression

## Machine Learning

A Linear Regression model is used to predict the final score of a student based on:

- Study Hours
- Attendance
- Assignment Score
- Previous Score

## Conclusion

The project demonstrates basic Data Science, data visualization, and Machine Learning concepts using Python.
